---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { SITE_URL } from '../data/site';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Car Wash Management"
  description="Terms and conditions for Car Wash Management, including SMS customer-care consent, STOP/HELP, message frequency, and message-and-data-rates disclosures."
  canonical={`${SITE_URL}/terms-and-conditions`}
  pageKey="terms"
  hideSticky={true}
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-950 mb-3">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-10">Car Wash Services LLC, doing business as Car Wash Management — Effective August 15, 2026</p>

    <div class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4">Introduction</h2>
      <p>By using <a class="text-[#0779ef] underline" href="https://www.carwashmgmt.com">www.carwashmgmt.com</a> or receiving SMS from Car Wash Management, you agree to these Terms. Website content is informational and does not create a paid engagement until confirmed in writing. Calculator estimates are illustrative only.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4">SMS customer-care program (separate consent)</h2>
      <p>SMS consent is optional and is not a condition of purchase. The only opt-in method is texting <strong>START</strong> to <strong>+1 619-914-6819</strong>. We do not collect SMS consent by website form, checkbox, paper form, or in-person process. Consent is collected separately from these website terms.</p>
      <p>By texting START, you agree to receive two-way customer-care texts from Car Wash Services LLC d/b/a Car Wash Management. Messages may include order and delivery updates, appointment follow-up, application or onboarding status, and replies to inbound questions.</p>
      <p>Message frequency varies. You may receive up to 8 customer-care messages per month, plus replies to messages you send us. Message and data rates may apply. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Text STOP to opt out. You will receive a confirmation and we will send no further SMS unless you opt in again.</li>
        <li>Text HELP for help, email info@carwashmgmt.com, or call 808-465-2291.</li>
        <li>Text START to opt in, or to resubscribe after an opt-out.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Information obtained as part of the SMS consent process will not be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. We do not share, sell, or provide your mobile phone number or messaging consent data to third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</p>
      <p>Privacy Policy: <a class="text-[#0779ef] underline" href="https://legal.carwashmgmt.com/privacy-policy.html">https://legal.carwashmgmt.com/privacy-policy.html</a> · site copy: <a class="text-[#0779ef] underline" href="/privacy-policy">https://www.carwashmgmt.com/privacy-policy</a></p>
      <p>A2P terms: <a class="text-[#0779ef] underline" href="https://legal.carwashmgmt.com/terms-and-conditions.html">https://legal.carwashmgmt.com/terms-and-conditions.html</a></p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4">Website and quotes</h2>
      <p>Product pricing is subject to change and confirmation at quote time. Do not use the site if you do not agree to these terms.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4">Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms by posting a revised version on this page. Continued use of the site or SMS program after posting means you accept the update. SMS opt-out via STOP remains available at all times.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4">Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions: <a class="text-[#0779ef] underline" href="mailto:info@carwashmgmt.com">info@carwashmgmt.com</a> · 808-465-2291</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
